                                "sense_id": "b129a993-799a-3d75-9b75-0ee5c94f6f2d",
                                "text": "The risk of going out of business was very real, they had suffered disastrous presidents, routinely lost their best players, and were effectively owned by a bailed-out bank, so Lim was welcomed as their saviour."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
